  - title: "Matem\xE1tica"
    description: "Formas, rela\xE7\xF5es, medidas e racioc\xEDnio l\xF3gico."
    accent: {r: 0.90588236, g: 0.5058824, b: 0.105882354, a: 1}
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b3d2cc4a6f464ce4ab9633f8b98da50e, type: 3}
    contents:
    - title: "Espa\xE7o cartesiano"
      description: "Crie pontos, retas, superf\xEDcies e s\xF3lidos. Manipule coordenadas
